            "heading": "If your bags are the inherited kind, this will not fix them — and we would rather say so",
            "body": "<p>If the fullness comes from <strong>inherited fat pads</strong> — the kind visible in photographs of you at twenty-five — no patch, cream or serum shifts those. Only surgery does.</p><p>What does respond is everything else: fluid, thinning skin, lost firmness, and the crepey texture that catches hard overhead light. That covers most men who end up on a page like this. If you are mostly the inherited kind, keep your money.</p>"
